    <title>A山回响新一期播客上线｜风口在变，什么能力不会过时？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac9aae2195d838e2aef9226</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac9aae2195d838e2aef9226</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:11:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期【A山回响】播客，我们把来自不同职业阶段的四位Sun Devil邀请进了录音间，聊聊校友们的通关秘籍。全员上桌，从新能源汽车、医疗科技，到国际贸易与金融法律行业，大声开麦，分享ASU带来的眼界、职场新人最值得期待的品质，以及时代变迁中自己行业的风向。</span></p><blockquote><p><span>本期【A山回响】时间轴</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 彩蛋先行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">00:01:45</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">00:06:39</a> 聊聊入行和跨界这些事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">00:18:09</a> AI浪潮下，职场与求职市场正在发生哪些变化？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1303">00:21:43</a> 医疗器械与农产品出海的机遇与挑战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">00:27:58</a> AI在律师界的“范式革命”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">00:32:03</a> 作为面试官，什么样的职场新人更受青睐？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2828">00:47:08</a> 分享那些ASU带给我们的成长与收获</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3428">00:57:08</a> 下一阶段的目标与规划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3771">01:02:51</a> 致ASU和Sun Devil的美好祝愿</span></p><blockquote><p><span>本期Sun Devil校友嘉宾</span></p></blockquote><p><span>王悦阳（2025 供应链管理、商业数据分析本科）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr0dWI7-wHI4OpxeLGbcEqU6v3o2.jpeg"><p><span>郭祥超（2019 金融硕士毕业）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm4XlnrSZu_XEG1fRN6le-mvMs1m.jpeg"><p><span>孙士茹（2019 供应链管理本科）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7BgBqahGFReiaeJ1PDznDMgE6x.jpeg"><p><span>李世程（2021 EMBA毕业）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiOkXHc99GK2HDc8613ThV91osmR.jpeg"><p><span>阅读更丰富的内容，可到ASU Alumni微信公众号推文👉🏻</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bd5rk86BLZsGQvTRt8ZB2A" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/bd5rk86BLZsGQvTRt8ZB2A"><span>《A山回响新一期播客上线｜风口在变，什么能力不会过时？》</span></a><span>和</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gdu7GrFCg5T0Lv_a67Q-BA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gdu7GrFCg5T0Lv_a67Q-BA"><span>《Sun Devil校友跨界聊商业命题，准备上桌｜A山回响返场预热》</span></a></p><blockquote><p><span>关注ASU Alumni</span></p></blockquote><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpiVaFByxkInGX1FpShJanoXCSew.jpg"><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh6Nw9TfhhZKCKxFTUGYMG0k36EJ.JPG"><p><span>视频号：ASUAlumni</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqvJIdkiiax__5Ux0dL2YuNDE3_T.JPG"><p><span>小红书：ASU Alumni</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmHk-v9zgSCRUlQGaZtnB5pIfk7F.JPG"><p><span>微博：亚利桑那州立大学ASU校友</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnX5bLIZrMKTyGyTeFkPWQFRAGBc.jpg"><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
