  <item>
    <title>&quot;不要抓紧迷雾中的工作&quot;｜A山回响【职场篇】｜ASU的毕业季特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68223c1bb7c8a9962cc3508b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68223c1bb7c8a9962cc3508b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 18:36:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>又是一年毕业季，无数Sun Devils拥抱人生可能性的契机。随着这个特殊节点的到来，A山回响特别推出【职场篇】，由LinkedIn前资深技术项目经理校友嘉宾给毕业生的反焦虑指南。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【A山回响职场篇】时间轴</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 彩蛋先行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 从ASU到硅谷大厂的“漂流体验”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 给毕业生的求职小提议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1419">23:39</a> 裸辞转型：找到比薪资更重要的生命成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 裸辞真相：比年薪更重要的是______</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3153">52:33</a> 职场人的消极困境：向内求索生命的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3696">01:01:36</a> 给新职场人：自我怀疑只是大脑设下的小陷阱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a> 给职场转型人士：看到焦虑背后的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4614">01:16:54</a> 给打工人：简单的冥想小技巧分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4928">01:22:08</a> 给应届生：开放地看待人生的可能性</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDlzN2Zow_GlpfJZEWBn4sOxooo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>友情分享，如果有找工作上面的支持需求，Sun Devil可以联系到蒙蒙校友，详情在播客最后</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：蒙蒙看见 ｜小红书：蒙蒙看见</span></p><span></span><p><span>A山回响是由ASU Alumni出品的播客，为中国sun devils量身定做，分享校友故事，探索职场与人生的可能性。 关于A山回响，你还希望未来有哪些话题：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期Sun Devil校友嘉宾：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>陈蒙 Meng Chen</span></p><span></span><p><span>’11 Master of Computer Science,</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ira A. Fulton Schools of Engineering</span></p><span></span><p><span>标签：灵性，启迪，INFP</span></p><span></span><p><span>中科大毕业后，她全奖来到ASU就读计算机专业硕士；在微软和Linkedin作为资深技术项目经理从业十余年，职场高峰选择裸辞，转身成为一名帮助他人探索内在的 Life/career Coach，蒙蒙校友换了一个视角，重新审视“成功”、“意义”与“职场规则”，目前她已有超过170场次的一对一及团体辅导经验，并主持了10余场工作坊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在亚利桑那有红色山石和仙人掌的旷达，来到湾区有骄阳和海风的开阔，路途中自有感悟，听她讲述如何从“随波逐流”到“清醒选择”，用自我觉察打破焦虑循环。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她娓娓道来的声音里，也许也有你的答案。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关注ASU Alumni</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：ASUAlumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bda7db3705bf500013c51d7?xsec_token=YBb499NK98v22WU8UNRhylVDrlUQFbKk6u4k1mu7AYJSM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c1e6be4000000000703e23f&amp;apptime=1736190849&amp;share_id=45ce7c79c9ce4e5d92673e2419d88fd9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bda7db3705bf500013c51d7?xsec_token=YBb499NK98v22WU8UNRhylVDrlUQFbKk6u4k1mu7AYJSM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c1e6be4000000000703e23f&amp;apptime=1736190849&amp;share_id=45ce7c79c9ce4e5d92673e2419d88fd9"><span>ASU Alumni</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://m.weibo.cn/u/6597008423?luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=231522type%3D1%26t%3D10%26q%3D%23ASU%23" data-url="https://m.weibo.cn/u/6597008423?luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=231522type%3D1%26t%3D10%26q%3D%23ASU%23"><span>亚利桑那州立大学ASU校友</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6267fc2331197fb8afe706ac/ltTanqdGMSN1fcuUZURn8RDqIKWX.m4a" length="73568331" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:48</itunes:duration>
