  <item>
    <title>vol.04 【A山回响】重磅回归！生活在“书”适圈里</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677b95bccda04ef4c1b883cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677b95bccda04ef4c1b883cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jan 2025 19:54:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>A山回响重磅回归！</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>A山回响是由ASU Alumni出品的播客，为中国sun devils量身定做，结识更多校友，分享共同记忆，探讨专业热点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025开年，我们的播客正式回归！本期「生活篇」上线后，5月毕业前后还将推出「职场篇」。私信或联系小助手，自荐或推荐其他ASU校友，成为下期嘉宾，畅聊你的职场故事！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7D4521jTppdsknKQwfomr46Kfj.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>A山回响-生活篇&amp;时间轴</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>本期“生活篇”我们邀请到的校友Zoe和Echo，她们从未相见，却一见如故，一开口就有无数相似之处：读书分享、教育专业背景、双双以4.0成绩从ASU硕士毕业.....</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU是她们在不同时空的相同经历，即使毕业后一位身处中国，一位长居美国，生活却是也可以在A山回响播客交汇，带来精彩的烟花。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> &nbsp;彩蛋先行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> &nbsp;嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> &nbsp;2024年的幸福故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> &nbsp;为什么选择ASU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> &nbsp;现在的工作和ASU的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> &nbsp;2024年最喜欢的一本书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2038">33:58</a> &nbsp;如何培养起读书的兴趣和习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> &nbsp;从“读书”到“分享”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2983">49:43</a> &nbsp;2025的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">54:08</a> &nbsp;对Sun Devil们的祝福</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>Sun Devil校友嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Echo Mu （'23 Psychology，New College of Interdisciplinary Arts &amp; Sciences)</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FivR6soAW7FHEOl5nVDrYXd5XQYd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>Zoe Cen （'18 Education，Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiX0ShK-5sFlfeg1hTp5H8o3zPar.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阅读更丰富的内容，可到ASU Alumni微信公众号推文👉🏻《A山回响播客重磅回归！生活在“书”适圈里》</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>关注ASU Alumni</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频号：ASUAlumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bda7db3705bf500013c51d7?xsec_token=YBb499NK98v22WU8UNRhylVDrlUQFbKk6u4k1mu7AYJSM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c1e6be4000000000703e23f&amp;apptime=1736190849&amp;share_id=45ce7c79c9ce4e5d92673e2419d88fd9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bda7db3705bf500013c51d7?xsec_token=YBb499NK98v22WU8UNRhylVDrlUQFbKk6u4k1mu7AYJSM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c1e6be4000000000703e23f&amp;apptime=1736190849&amp;share_id=45ce7c79c9ce4e5d92673e2419d88fd9"><span>ASU Alumni</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>微博：</span><a href="https://m.weibo.cn/u/6597008423?luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=231522type%3D1%26t%3D10%26q%3D%23ASU%23" data-url="https://m.weibo.cn/u/6597008423?luicode=10000011&amp;lfid=231522type%3D1%26t%3D10%26q%3D%23ASU%23"><span>亚利桑那州立大学ASU校友</span></a></p>]]></description>
