    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在ASU除了课程带来的收获，在这片热土上更塑造了他对于事物的认知态度、对于眼界的追求和看待问题的角度，从内而外以更宽广的视野迈向未来。亦师亦友的ASU教授Daniel Collins成为了影响若琨一生的引路人。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmolLpeVN9nWXnw_DTQre3hKYbHU.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阅读完整故事，可到ASU Alumni微信公众号推文《用交互艺术深度造梦｜陈若琨｜A面人生》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Vol.2 时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 留学思维方式转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 导师是自己人生改变最大的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 导师用艺术潜移默化促进社区发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="274">04:34</a> 触发自己对未来和职业的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关注ASU Alumni】</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：亚利桑那州立大学ASU校友</span></p>]]></description>
