  <item>
    <title>用交互艺术深度造梦｜陈若琨｜A面人生 Vol.1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/649dd5adfb908e66d5bb0bbf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">649dd5adfb908e66d5bb0bbf</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 29 Jun 2023 19:04:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>陈若琨在4年前的ASU Alumni专访中被我们称为“光影魔术手”，一出道就以极具创意的交互作品技惊四座，酣畅淋漓的数字媒体艺术表现让人耳目一新。和校友再次接触，看到他带着更大的团队，作为行业“造梦者”——从商业角度和教育角度，他谈起这几年里的成长和责任。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmolLpeVN9nWXnw_DTQre3hKYbHU.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>阅读完整故事，可到ASU Alumni微信公众号推文</span><strong><span>《用交互艺术深度造梦｜陈若琨｜A面人生》</span></strong><br><span> </span><br><span>【Vol.1 时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 为什么来到ASU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 也体验过做留学中介创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 毕业后从芝加哥工作到回国创业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 从Digital FUN到TEA新媒体社区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 商业活动和课程的淡旺季相交替</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> “松弛感”营造最舒适的工作环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 打破固有思维</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【关注ASU Alumni】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：亚利桑那州立大学ASU校友</span></p>]]></description>
