    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632e45029186d4e4c46a03f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632e45029186d4e4c46a03f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Sep 2022 23:45:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>【时间轴】</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 彩蛋先行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 从社区大学来到ASU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">01:16</a> 从钢琴，到日语，到油画的触类旁通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="359">05:59</a>在社区大学两年和ASU的三年一直保持在绩点4.0难吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a>从选择比较谨慎到更大胆的选择，这个过程中有什么转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="516">08:36</a> 我不是一个自信的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a>荣誉学院也有很多有意思的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> &nbsp;在ASU上过很多跟本专业八竿子打不着的课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="783">13:03</a> 我其实不会时间管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a> 为何对教育学感兴趣从而读研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 放过自己，减少焦虑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lszj0P96UCxTwzi7tb7ODsd9HvdI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
