  <item>
    <title>vol.03 A山回响｜领导与被领导的艺术</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62e41c7f9f87279faacd8634</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62e41c7f9f87279faacd8634</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Jul 2022 17:44:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【A山回响】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>从A山出发，在职场起航，每一步都是无畏探索；可能健步如飞，也可能面对崎岖，但都是成长的标记！从学生到职场的转变中，要面对多重的身份，有些经验，可能在选择专业时就埋下伏笔。</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>第三期，第三期A山回响，和校友畅聊领导与被领导的艺术，跨越到最初的梦想，从进入ASU说起</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Sun Devil校友嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>高金路 Tony （’20 BA, &nbsp;W.P. Carey Business school)</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>Kelsey （’15 BA in Educational Studies, &nbsp;’17 Master's in TESOL ）</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 彩蛋开场</span></strong><span>：职场里这些也能说？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> 关于嘉宾</span></strong><span>：大学教师 V.S.铁矿石掉期经纪人</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a> 如何来到这个行业</span></strong><span>：哪些机缘巧合？</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> 领导力的作用</span></strong><span>：哪些领导力特质带给你一些机会、认可</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 现场互动</span></strong><span>：遇到“猪队友”和“拎不清”的领导，还能怎么保证工作能做好</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 刚进入职场“被领导”</span></strong><span>：如何克服新人的困难</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 畅谈理想职场</span></strong><span>：愿意领导还是被领导</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【关注ASU Alumni】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><br></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p><span></span><p><br></p>]]></description>
