  <item>
    <title>vol.01 说说工作这件事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62745372bd03134a5aea403e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62745372bd03134a5aea403e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 May 2022 22:45:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在刚过去不久的四月，四位ASU校友嘉宾围绕</span><strong><span>“工作、选择、人生</span></strong><span>”畅谈了自己的故事，与录制现场在线的校友们一同度过了珍贵的时光，sun devils的精妙生活语录，都在这里了！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Sun Devil校友嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>白雨微 ’13 M.S. in Engineering 工程学院</span></p><span></span><p><span>于琪 ’14 Master of Public Admin 公共事务学院</span></p><span></span><p><span>辛子豪 ’19 B.S in Applied Math 文理学院</span></p><span></span><p><span>何乔茜 ’19 B.A. in Philosophy 文理学院 &nbsp;B.A. in Museum Studies 设计艺术学院</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【 时间轴 】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>sun devils金句频出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a>天南地北背景大公开</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a>所学专业和现在做的事情“对口”吗？在ASU学到的东西为你带来了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a>初入职场的工作状态？这个阶段有什么记忆深刻的事件？具体的困难？如何度过这个阶段？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1547">25:47</a>困难？瓶颈？人生转折点？最深刻的记忆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1947">32:27</a>疫情带来了哪些影响？如何应对？</span></p><span></span><p><a href="http://asualumni.mikecrm.com/EnfPqCJ" data-url="http://asualumni.mikecrm.com/EnfPqCJ"><strong><span>【下期播客由你定制】</span></strong></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Foo-Y2RowM7a1HCfJ0j62l0XlPrh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【关注ASU Alumni】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：ASU Alumni</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASU中国校友官方微信：ArizonaStateSundevil</span></p>]]></description>
